<title>USA: Noble Drilling to buy back up to 10 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Noble Drilling to buy back up to 10 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noble Drilling Corp said Monday its board has authorized the repurchase of up to 10 million of its common shares, representing about 8 percent of the company's outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The shares will be repurchased periodically and on the open market or in private negotiations at prices determined by the company, it said.</p>
<p>Noble is an offshore drilling contractor with operations in the United States, Canada, Mexico, the North Sea, Africa, the Middle East, South America and India.</p>
